---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="Power Your Factory | Wind & Hybrid Energy for C&I and MSMEs | OnLoop Energy" description="OnLoop Energy designs wind-first, hybrid-optimized captive power systems exclusively for Commercial, Industrial, and MSME facilities. Cut energy costs — no tenders, no bureaucracy, just site-specific engineering.">
<div>
      

      




      {/* Hero Section */}
      <section class="hero hero--image" style="background-image: url('/images/stock/solarfarm.webp');">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="hero__content">
            <div class="hero__badge" style="margin-top: var(--space-8);">
              <span class="hero__badge-dot"></span>
              Wind & Hybrid Energy for C&I and MSMEs
            </div>
            <h1 class="hero__title">
              Power Your Factory, Not the Bureaucracy.<br />
              <span class="hero__title-highlight">Wind & Hybrid Energy for C&I and MSMEs.</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="hero__subtitle">Engineering-first, site-specific renewable energy that reduces your electricity bills — no government tenders, no residential distractions, just low-cost captive power.</p>
            
            <div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid var(--color-primary); padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4); border-radius: var(--radius-md); margin-bottom: var(--space-6); max-width: 680px;">
              <p style="margin: 0; font-size: var(--font-size-sm); color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9); font-weight: 500;">
                ⚡ <strong>Cut energy costs. Secure your production.</strong> No tenders, no red tape — just engineering.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hero__actions">
              <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">Get Free Feasibility Study</a>
              <a href="/wind" class="btn btn--secondary btn--large">Explore Wind & Hybrid</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        {/* Decorative visual element */}
        <div class="hero__visual">
          <div class="hero__graphic">
            <div class="hero__graphic-circle"></div>
            <div class="hero__graphic-circle"></div>
            <div class="hero__graphic-circle"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="scroll-indicator">
          <span>Scroll</span>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M7 13l5 5 5-5M7 6l5 5 5-5" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* Explicit Exclusion Statement Trust Banner */}
      <div style="background: rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.08); border-top: 1px solid rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.2); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31, 183, 166, 0.2); padding: var(--space-4) 0;">
        <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--font-size-base); color: var(--color-text-primary);">
            🛡️ <strong>Exclusively Private B2B:</strong> OnLoop Energy focuses exclusively on Commercial, Industrial, and MSME facilities. We do not undertake residential installations or government/public sector projects.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Intro / Overview */}
      <section class="content-section fade-in">
        <div class="container container--narrow" style="text-align: center;">
          <h2 class="content-section__title" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">Clean energy works best when it is
            engineered for the site, not forced onto it.</h2>
          <p class="content-section__text">At OnLoop Energy, we work exclusively with Commercial, Industrial, and MSME facilities — not residential, not government. We combine technical site intelligence, genuine wind and solar resource assessment, and disciplined EPC execution to deliver wind and hybrid energy systems that perform to their design yield, year after year.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* Who We Serve - Segmented Grid */}
      <section class="content-section content-section--light fade-in">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="content-section__header">
            <span class="content-section__label">Target Audience</span>
            <h2 class="content-section__title">Tailored Solutions for C&I and MSMEs</h2>
            <p class="content-section__text">Different businesses have different operational pain points. We design captive energy architectures specifically for your operational reality.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-2">
            {/* Commercial & Industrial */}
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card__icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M2 20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-7 5V8l-7 5V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z" />
                  <path d="M17 18h1" />
                  <path d="M12 18h1" />
                  <path d="M7 18h1" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="card__title">Commercial & Industrial (Large Factories & Warehouses)</h4>
              <p class="card__text"><strong>The Pain Points:</strong> High peak demand charges, diesel backup costs, and carbon compliance pressure.<br /><br /><strong>OnLoop Solution:</strong> Shave your peak demand with on-site captive wind + hybrid power. Reduce grid dependence and achieve energy security at scale.</p>
            </div>
            {/* MSMEs */}
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card__icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2" />
                  <path d="M3 9h18" />
                  <path d="M9 21V9" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="card__title">MSMEs (Surat Dyeing, Food Processing, Foundries, Cold Storage)</h4>
              <p class="card__text"><strong>The Pain Points:</strong> Thin margins, rising grid tariffs (₹7–10+/unit), limited rooftop space, and lack of technical staff.<br /><br /><strong>OnLoop Solution:</strong> Compact, high-yield wind systems that work day and night. No complex operations — just reliable power that lowers per-unit production cost.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* Solutions Overview */}
      <section class="content-section fade-in">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="content-section__header">
            <span class="content-section__label">Solutions Overview</span>
            <h2 class="content-section__title">Wind. Hybrid. Nothing Else.</h2>
            <p class="content-section__text">We focus on two technologies: small wind turbines and hybrid (wind + solar) systems. No BESS, no pure solar, no residential. Every solution is site-specific and engineered for a specific C&I context.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-3">
            <div class="image-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532601224476-15c79f2f7a51?w=600&h=400&fit=crop"
                alt="Commercial small wind turbines site-specific installation for industrial facility" loading="lazy" />
              <div class="image-card__caption">
                <h4>Small Wind Turbine Systems</h4>
                <p>Deployed only at sites where wind resource data genuinely supports long-term performance. Generates power 24/7 — including nights, weekends, and monsoon season when solar output is zero.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="image-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1466611653911-95081537e5b7?w=600&h=400&fit=crop"
                alt="Hybrid wind and solar energy system for commercial and industrial facility" loading="lazy" />
              <div class="image-card__caption">
                <h4>Hybrid Energy Systems (Wind + Solar)</h4>
                <p>A single engineered architecture combining daytime solar with wind generation across the full diurnal and seasonal cycle. Higher CUF, better land utilization, and true 24/7 coverage for demanding C&I loads.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="image-card">
              <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509391366360-2e959784a276?w=600&h=400&fit=crop"
                alt="Solar panels as part of a hybrid energy system for industrial use" loading="lazy" />
              <div class="image-card__caption">
                <h4>Solar — Only Within Hybrid</h4>
                <p>We use solar as the daytime generation layer in our hybrid systems. We do not install solar-only systems. If your load profile calls for solar-only, we will tell you honestly and point you to the right specialist.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* Our Philosophy */}
      <section class="content-section content-section--light fade-in">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="grid-2">
            <div>
              <span class="content-section__label">Our Philosophy</span>
              <h2 class="content-section__title">Energy systems designed for your reality.</h2>
              <p class="content-section__text">Every C&I site is different. A three-shift ceramics factory has a fundamentally different energy profile from a logistics hub or a textile mill. Wind resources vary by altitude, proximity to the coast, and seasonal patterns.</p>
              <p class="content-section__text">At OnLoop Energy, we don't arrive with a product to sell. We arrive with data. We assess your site's actual wind resource, map it against your operational load curve, and only then determine whether small wind, hybrid, or neither is the right path forward.</p>
              <div
                style="margin-top: var(--space-8); padding: var(--space-6); background: rgba(30; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary);">
                <h4 style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2); color: var(--color-primary); font-size: var(--font-size-lg);">
                  Engineering is not an add-on.</h4>
                <p
                  style="margin-bottom: 0; font-weight: 500; font-size: var(--font-size-base); color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
                  It is the foundation of performance.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <div class="card__icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M2 22h20" />
                  <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6" />
                  <path d="M12,13 12,21.5" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="card__title">Site-Specific Design</h4>
              <p class="card__text">
                We analyze your location's specific resource data, sun irradiance, wind speeds, and
                energy consumption patterns, to design a system that maximizes output and ROI, regardless of the
                technology.<br /><br />
                Using detailed modelling and financial analysis, we design a system architecture that optimizes output,
                stability, and long-term cost of energy, not just installed capacity.
                <br /><br />
                The result is a technically sound, financially viable energy system engineered for measurable performance.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 3-Step MSME Onboarding Flow */}
      <section class="content-section fade-in" style="background: var(--color-bg-light);">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="content-section__header" style="max-width: 900px;">
            <span class="content-section__label">Simple 3-Step Process</span>
            <h2 class="content-section__title">How We Partner With MSMEs & Factories</h2>
            <p class="content-section__text">No bureaucratic red tape. No long tender cycles. A simple engineering pathway to lower power bills.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-3" style="align-items: stretch;">
            {/* Step 1 */}
            <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-8); position: relative;">
              <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-primary); opacity: 0.2; position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 20px;">01</div>
              <div class="card__icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                  <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z" />
                  <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8" />
                  <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13" />
                  <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="card__title">1. Share Your Electricity Bill</h4>
              <p class="card__text">Upload or send your recent utility bill and facility location. We analyze your tariff rates, peak demand charges, and consumption curve.</p>
            </div>
            {/* Step 2 */}
            <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-8); position: relative;">
              <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-primary); opacity: 0.2; position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 20px;">02</div>
              <div class="card__icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                  <path d="M9.59 4.59A2 2 0 1 1 11 8H2m10.59 11.41A2 2 0 1 0 14 16H2m15.73-8.27A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 19.5 12H2" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="card__title">2. Free Wind Feasibility</h4>
              <p class="card__text">We evaluate your site’s wind resource and space availability at zero cost. If wind data doesn't justify the investment, we tell you up-front.</p>
            </div>
            {/* Step 3 */}
            <div class="card" style="background: #ffffff; padding: var(--space-8); position: relative;">
              <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-primary); opacity: 0.2; position: absolute; top: 16px; right: 20px;">03</div>
              <div class="card__icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
                  <polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2" />
                  <polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17" />
                  <polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="card__title">3. Captive Hybrid Engineering</h4>
              <p class="card__text">We engineer, install, and commission your site-specific captive power plant — delivering measurable monthly savings from day one.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: var(--space-8);">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">Get Your Free Feasibility Study</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* Why OnLoop */}
      <section class="content-section content-section--light fade-in">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="content-section__header">
            <span class="content-section__label">Why OnLoop Energy</span>
            <h2 class="content-section__title">Built for long-term performance</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-3">
            <div class="card card--light">
              <div class="card__icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5">
                  <path
                    d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="card__title">Engineering-led</h4>
              <p class="card__text">
                We are not sales-driven. Every recommendation is backed by rigourous technical
                validation and real-site data.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card card--light">
              <div class="card__icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5">
                  <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14" />
                  <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="card__title">Honest Feasibility</h4>
              <p class="card__text">
                We tell you what works and what doesn't, upfront. If a site doesn't support wind or
                solar, we say so.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card card--light">
              <div class="card__icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5">
                  <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z" />
                  <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="card__title">Site-Specific</h4>
              <p class="card__text">
                No templates. We study your specific load profiles and resource data to build a custom
                energy architecture.</p>
            <div class="card card--light">
              <div class="card__icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5">
                  <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
                  <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" />
                  <polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="card__title">Single Accountability</h4>
              <p class="card__text">
                We take ownership of the entire lifecycle, from the first feasibility study to long-term
                operations.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card card--light">
              <div class="card__icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="1.5">
                  <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="15" rx="2" ry="2" />
                  <polyline points="17 2 12 7 7 2" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="card__title">Wind-First Thinking</h4>
              <p class="card__text">We ask what your wind data says before recommending any technology. Solar alone cannot run a three-shift factory. Wind often can — when the site genuinely supports it.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* AI-SEO FAQ Block */}
      <section class="content-section content-section--white fade-in" style="padding: var(--space-12) 0;">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="content-section__header">
            <h2 class="content-section__title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <p class="content-section__text">Direct answers to common questions about our commercial hybrid energy systems.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid-2" style="gap: var(--space-8);">
            <div>
              <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">What is a Commercial Hybrid Energy System?</h3>
              <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">
                A commercial hybrid energy system integrates multiple renewable generation sources—typically industrial solar panels and small wind turbines—into a single, coordinated energy architecture. By combining daytime solar generation with nighttime or seasonal wind generation, hybrid systems deliver higher energy availability and resilience than standalone solar or wind systems.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); margin-bottom: var(--space-2);">Why choose OnLoop Energy as your EPC partner?</h3>
              <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.6;">
                OnLoop Energy is an engineering-first EPC provider. According to our site-specific feasibility approach, we evaluate actual consumption profiles and resource data before recommending a solution. This ensures commercial and industrial facilities receive energy architectures engineered for long-term financial performance and reliability, rather than generic equipment packages.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* Final CTA */}
      <section class="cta-section fade-in">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="cta-section__content">
            <h2 class="cta-section__title">Let’s design the right energy system for your site</h2>
            <p class="cta-section__text">If you run a manufacturing plant, processing facility, industrial estate, or large commercial operation — and you want to know whether small wind or hybrid energy makes economic sense for your site — that conversation starts here.</p>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">
              Contact OnLoop Energy
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="20" height="20">
                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12" />
                <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      



    </div>

</AppLayout>
